# doi: "10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX"   # add the concept DOI after the first Zenodo release
abstract: >-
  An open glossary of 62 AI roleplay and AI companion terms (character cards, greetings, lorebooks, scenarios, story arcs, memory types from context window to saved facts, RAG and long-term memory, character drift, swipes, temperature, system prompts, jailbreaks, SFW/NSFW, age assurance and dere archetypes). Each entry has an original definition, alternative names, an example, related terms and source URLs. Provided as CSV, JSON and schema.org DefinedTermSet JSON-LD.
keywords:
  - "AI roleplay"
  - "AI RP"
  - "AI companion"
  - "AI chatbot"
  - "AI character chat"
  - "glossary"
  - "character card"
  - "lorebook"
  - "long-term memory"
  - "context window"
  - "character drift"
  - "dere types"
  - "DefinedTermSet"
